        "BOG_PATHFINDER_BODY_SECONDARY_DASH_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>Procure</style> breve spatium. Proxima vice arte primaria uteris, <style=cIsDamage>hastam explosivam</style> iace pro <style=cIsDamage>800% damno</style>.",
