        "BOG_PATHFINDER_BODY_UTILITY_SPIN_DESCRIPTION": "In aerem surge, celeriter rotans pro <style=cIsDamage>300% damno</style>. In terram descendens, tractum horizontalem fac pro <style=cIsDamage>800% damno</style>.",
        "BOG_PATHFINDER_BODY_UTILITY_BOLAS_NAME": "Bolae Electrica",
        "BOG_PATHFINDER_BODY_UTILITY_BOLAS_DESCRIPTION": "Bolas electrica iace quae hostes propinquos <style=cIsUtility>feriunt</style> et campum <style=cIsUtility>electrificans</style> per <style=cIsUtility>10 secundas</style> relinquunt.",
        "BOG_PATHFINDER_BODY_SPECIAL_COMMAND_NAME": "Iube",
        "BOG_PATHFINDER_BODY_SPECIAL_COMMAND2_NAME": "Iube - Superscriptio Utilitatis",
        "BOG_PATHFINDER_BODY_SPECIAL_COMMAND_DESCRIPTION": "Praepara mandatum pro Squall. Mandatum <color=#FF0000>Impetendi</color>, <color=#00FF00>Sequendi</color> aut <color=#efeb1c>Speciale</color> dari potest premendo claves artis Primariae, Secundariae aut Specialis respective.",
